    {
      "id": "W9hipdLzKgg",
      "title": "FATAL FURY: CotW｜Nintendo Switch 2 Launch Trailer",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T07:00:10Z",
      "durationSec": 84,
      "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/W9hipdLzKgg/mqdefault.jpg",
      "description": "The Nintendo Switch™ 2 version lets players experience the explosive fighting action of FATAL FURY: City of the Wolves anytime, anywhere. Choose from two editions: the Standard Edition ($19.99/€19.99), which includes the base game, and the Starter Edition ($29.99/€29.99), featuring the base game plus a wealth of additional content—including the Season Pass 1–3 character lineup.\n\nDigital are available now via Nintendo eShop. The Starter Edition will also be released in a physical format on January 21, 2027, with preorders opening soon at participating retailers.\n\n💻Official Site \nhttps://www.snk-corp.co.jp/us/games/fatalfury-cotw/\n📶X\nhttps://x.com/FATALFURY_PR\n📶Instagram\nhttps://www.instagram.com/fatalfury_pr/\n📶TikTok\nhttps://www.tiktok.com/@fatalfury_cotw\n\n©SNK CORPORATION ALL RIGHTS RESERVED. \n#FatalFury #餓狼伝説 #CotW #SNK",
